WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.336
-The president lied about
his reaction

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.905
to a vile racist chant
at his rally last night.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:08.007
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:09.275
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.777 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:15.315
There's a tendency among some
in the media and in D.C.

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:17.717
to interpret every unhinged
Trump outburst

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:19.952
as some sort of
calculated political chess move

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:22.989
designed to corner Democrats in
a politically difficult spot,

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:24.157
which doesn't make much sense.

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:26.593
I mean, last night,
he tried to talk about

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:27.993
an upcoming special election

00:00:27.993 --> 00:00:30.095
in North Carolina's
9th Congressional District

00:00:30.095 --> 00:00:32.131
and his brain melted down

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:35.401
just trying to get those words
out of his mouth.

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:37.670
-There is another
crucial election

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.539
in North Carolina's "Nith
Conde--"

00:00:40.539 --> 00:00:43.376
Right? You know what
we're talking about?

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:45.177
-No.

00:00:45.177 --> 00:00:47.413
No, we don't.
Trump always sounds like

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:49.815
he went to grab some water

00:00:49.815 --> 00:00:54.621
and accidentally drank
an entire bottle of Novocaine.

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:58.958
Trump isn't some genius
political chess master.

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:01.560
He's a racist whose brain
is mostly oatmeal

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.662
and his mouth is attached
to Fox News

00:01:03.662 --> 00:01:05.498
like some kind of human
centipede.

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.866
He is a wannabe authoritarian

00:01:07.866 --> 00:01:09.435
who craves the adoration
of crowds,

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:11.604
and that's why he opened
his rally

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:13.873
in North Carolina last night
by telling the crowd

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:15.641
he would be there all night

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:17.743
because he had nothing else
to do.

00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:20.046
-We have all night. We can
have a lot of fun tonight.

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:21.948
I have nothing to do.
Nothing! Nothing!

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:23.483
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:26.252
-Cool.
We all have to work tomorrow.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.953
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.953 --> 00:01:29.321
Seriously,
you have nothing to do?

00:01:29.321 --> 00:01:31.223
You're the president!

00:01:31.223 --> 00:01:32.558
And, look, on some level,

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:33.893
it's comforting to know
that Trump

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:35.228
isn't actually doing anything.

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:38.531
In fact, I'd prefer it
if he spent all his time

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.533
crawling around.

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:44.270
That's what we want, right?

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.839
-On all fours like
some sort of bloated possum.

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:48.674
I mean, look at him.

00:01:48.674 --> 00:01:50.943
Looks like he just saw
a chicken nugget in the wild

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:53.079
and he's trying to
sneak up on it.

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:54.881
[ As Trump ] Easy.

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:57.650
Don't startle the nest.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.118
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.118 --> 00:02:01.721
Get 'em quick before
the mama comes back.

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:05.024
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:06.592
[ Normal voice ]
So Trump is obviously

00:02:06.592 --> 00:02:07.861
no political mastermind.

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:08.994
In fact, last night he tried

00:02:08.994 --> 00:02:11.764
to mention Congresswoman
Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:14.167
and clearly could not remember
her name.

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:16.969
-But Cortez -- Somebody said
that's not her name.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:18.871
It's..."

00:02:18.871 --> 00:02:20.139
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:22.342
They said,
"That's not her name, sir."

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:24.810
I said, "No, no.
I don't have time

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.813
go with three different names.

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:29.148
We'll call her Cortez."

00:02:29.148 --> 00:02:31.216
Too much time.
Takes too much time.

00:02:31.216 --> 00:02:33.519
-I wonder if he uses
that excuse with his kids.

00:02:33.519 --> 00:02:35.988
[ As Trump ] I can't remember
three different names.

00:02:35.988 --> 00:02:38.558
I'm just gonna call you
Ivanka and the losers.

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:40.059
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:42.795
[ Normal voice ] Also, I love
how he can't even hide the fact

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:44.530
that he just couldn't remember
her name.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.299
His brain short circuited
so badly,

00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:49.068
all he could do was make
a hissing noise.

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:51.704
-Somebody said that's not
her name, it'ssssssssss...

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:53.606
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:56.075
-Sounds like he's letting
the air out of a balloon.

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:58.477
[ As Trump ] Uh-oh! Uh-oh!
There go my words!

00:02:58.477 --> 00:03:01.680
Ssssssssssssssss!

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.682
[ Normal voice ] This is when
Trump is in his element.

00:03:03.682 --> 00:03:06.152
He gives his base
the performance they want.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:08.354
And that's what he did again
last night when he whipped them

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:10.723
into a racist frenzy
by slandering

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:12.658
Minnesota Congresswoman
Ilhan Omar,

00:03:12.658 --> 00:03:15.027
a Somalian refugee
and naturalized citizen.

00:03:15.027 --> 00:03:17.296
Trump has been attacking her
all week with racist lies,

00:03:17.296 --> 00:03:19.832
and the crowd responded
with a truly horrific chant

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:21.401
while Trump just stood by.

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:24.904
-She looks down with contempt
on the hardworking American,

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:28.274
saying that ignorance
is pervasive

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:30.810
in many parts of this country.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.845
[ Crowd booing ]

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:35.348
-Send her back!

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:39.185
And obviously and importantly,

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:41.421
Omar has a history

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:46.358
of launching vicious
anti-Semitic screams.

00:03:46.358 --> 00:03:49.462
[ Crowd chanting
"Send her back!" ]

00:03:59.338 --> 00:04:01.240
-This is one
of the most vile spectacles

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:04.243
in modern political history, a
defining moment for our country.

00:04:04.243 --> 00:04:06.345
Any Republican who doesn't
immediately condemn it

00:04:06.345 --> 00:04:07.513
should imagine how it will look

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:09.081
in a history textbook
years from now

00:04:09.081 --> 00:04:11.851
because there will absolutely
be a section on this

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:14.553
and it will absolutely name
everyone complicit in it

00:04:14.553 --> 00:04:17.089
and they will absolutely use
the worst photo of you

00:04:17.089 --> 00:04:18.725
they can possibly find.

00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:20.326
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:24.063
That's how it works. Historians
get to pick the photos.

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:26.565
Yet, despite the fact that Trump
spent the rally

00:04:26.565 --> 00:04:28.868
and the preceding three days
spreading racist lies

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:30.803
and telling the Omar and three
other Congresswomen

00:04:30.803 --> 00:04:32.204
to go back to their countries,

00:04:32.204 --> 00:04:34.273
he actually tried to claim
in the oval office today

00:04:34.273 --> 00:04:37.043
that he didn't like the chant
and tried to stop it,

00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:39.578
which is, again, an obvious lie.

00:04:39.578 --> 00:04:43.115
-When your supporters last night
were chanting, "Send her back,"

00:04:43.115 --> 00:04:44.350
why didn't you stop them?

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.552
Why didn't you ask them to stop
saying that?

00:04:46.552 --> 00:04:48.488
-Well, number one,
I think I did.

00:04:48.488 --> 00:04:50.289
I started speaking very quickly.

00:04:50.289 --> 00:04:54.159
It really was a loud --
I disagree with it, by the way.

00:04:54.159 --> 00:04:56.296
But it was quite a chant.

00:04:56.296 --> 00:05:00.566
And I felt a little bit badly
about it,

00:05:00.566 --> 00:05:02.835
but I will say this, I did --

00:05:02.835 --> 00:05:04.603
And I started speaking
very quickly.

00:05:04.603 --> 00:05:06.172
-No, no, no, you didn't.

00:05:06.172 --> 00:05:08.274
When they started chanting,
you just let 'em go.

00:05:08.274 --> 00:05:09.942
You said nothing.

00:05:09.942 --> 00:05:12.578
[ Crowd chanting
"Send her back!" ]

00:05:22.187 --> 00:05:24.023
-That's not how you stop
a chant.

00:05:24.023 --> 00:05:25.291
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:28.594
That's how you wait in line
at the deli for them

00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:30.797
to call your number.

00:05:30.797 --> 00:05:32.231
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.231 --> 00:05:37.904
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:37.904 --> 00:05:40.239
[ Laughter ]

00:05:40.239 --> 00:05:42.308
Also, you didn't start speaking
very quickly.

00:05:42.308 --> 00:05:43.675
We've seen you speak
very quickly.

00:05:43.675 --> 00:05:45.978
Sometimes you speak so quickly
your words slur

00:05:45.978 --> 00:05:48.648
and face turns red
and you start gasping for air

00:05:48.648 --> 00:05:50.950
like a whale coming up
out of the water.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:55.621
-[ Gasping ]

00:05:55.621 --> 00:05:57.856
-But this is con at the heart
of Trump's politics --

00:05:57.856 --> 00:05:59.925
He whips his base
into a racist frenzy

00:05:59.925 --> 00:06:01.894
And claims Omar is the one
who looks down

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:03.762
on hardworking Americans,
when in reality,

00:06:03.762 --> 00:06:05.464
he's the one plundering
the government,

00:06:05.464 --> 00:06:07.967
doling out trillions in tax cuts
to his rich buddies,

00:06:07.967 --> 00:06:09.201
and partying it up all night

00:06:09.201 --> 00:06:11.703
because he doesn't have to work
on Thursdays.

00:06:11.703 --> 00:06:13.839
In fact, he lied to his audience
again last night

00:06:13.839 --> 00:06:15.574
about his administration's
repeated attempts

00:06:15.574 --> 00:06:17.342
to strip healthcare away
from millions

00:06:17.342 --> 00:06:20.613
and told a bizarre story about
a run-in with a fellow rich guy

00:06:20.613 --> 00:06:21.881
who loves what Trump is doing,

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:24.116
even though he dislikes Trump
personally.

00:06:24.116 --> 00:06:26.452
-A man I know who I don't like,
a businessman,

00:06:26.452 --> 00:06:29.822
very, very, very successful,
one of the most successful men.

00:06:29.822 --> 00:06:31.323
I don't like him.
Never liked him.

00:06:31.323 --> 00:06:33.425
He never liked me, either,
by the way.

00:06:33.425 --> 00:06:37.863
In fact, I would go a step
further -- he cannot stand me.

00:06:37.863 --> 00:06:41.000
I saw him about two months ago.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.202
And he came up to me.
I said, "How you doing?"

00:06:44.202 --> 00:06:47.006
Very warm.
"Hey, how you doing?

00:06:47.006 --> 00:06:49.342
Oh, let's get out of here."

00:06:49.342 --> 00:06:51.377
And he said, "I'm doing good.
You doing good?"

00:06:51.377 --> 00:06:54.280
I said, "Yeah."
I said, "You know,

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.415
you don't like me
and I don't like you,

00:06:56.415 --> 00:06:59.351
I never have liked you
and you never have liked me.

00:06:59.351 --> 00:07:02.255
But you're gonna support me
because you're a rich guy,

00:07:02.255 --> 00:07:03.689
and if you don't support me,

00:07:03.689 --> 00:07:06.859
you're gonna be so goddamn poor,
you're not gonna believe it.

00:07:06.859 --> 00:07:08.161
It's true.

00:07:08.161 --> 00:07:09.895
-There are a million reasons

00:07:09.895 --> 00:07:13.732
that story is obviously
a lie he made up.

00:07:13.732 --> 00:07:15.701
One of which is, you're the
president of the United States.

00:07:15.701 --> 00:07:18.270
Where are you just
running into people?!

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:20.506
[ As Trump ] And so I was like,
"Hey," and he was like, "Hey."

00:07:20.506 --> 00:07:22.975
And I'm like,
"Are you getting Jamba Juice?"

00:07:22.975 --> 00:07:24.977
And he's like,
"Yeah, what about you?"

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:27.312
And I'm like,
"Yeah. I already ordered,

00:07:27.312 --> 00:07:31.918
but they haven't said
my name yet.

00:07:31.918 --> 00:07:34.720
Just waiting for them
to call my name."

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.155
[ Laughter ]

00:07:36.155 --> 00:07:39.692
[ Normal voice ] But that's
who Donald Trump works for --

00:07:39.692 --> 00:07:41.093
the corporations and wealthy

00:07:41.093 --> 00:07:42.695
and he thinks he can
lie about it to voters

00:07:42.695 --> 00:07:45.164
While keeping his base in line
with racist incitement.

00:07:45.164 --> 00:07:47.433
For example, after the House
voted on a resolution

00:07:47.433 --> 00:07:49.468
to condemn Trump's
racist attacks this week

00:07:49.468 --> 00:07:51.570
and Republicans almost entirely
sided with Trump,

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:52.772
Trump tweeted this --

00:07:52.772 --> 00:07:54.072
-So great to see how unified

00:07:54.072 --> 00:07:56.742
the Republican Party was
on today's vote concerning

00:07:56.742 --> 00:07:59.678
statements I made about
four Democratic Congresswoman.

00:07:59.678 --> 00:08:01.981
If you really want to see
statements,

00:08:01.981 --> 00:08:04.382
look at the horrible things
they've said about our country,

00:08:04.382 --> 00:08:06.151
Israel, and much more.

00:08:06.151 --> 00:08:08.921
They are now the top most
visible members

00:08:08.921 --> 00:08:11.424
of the House Democrats
who are now wedded

00:08:11.424 --> 00:08:12.858
to this bitterness and hate.

00:08:12.858 --> 00:08:16.395
The Republican vote was 187-4.
Wow!

00:08:16.395 --> 00:08:18.898
-I like when Trump tries to use
a flowery phrase

00:08:18.898 --> 00:08:20.799
like "wedded to
this bitterness and hate,"

00:08:20.799 --> 00:08:23.703
and then immediately follows it
up with something dumb,

00:08:23.703 --> 00:08:26.305
like "Wow!"

00:08:26.305 --> 00:08:27.473
It's like if Charles Dickens

00:08:27.473 --> 00:08:29.241
had started
"The Tale of Two Cities" with,

00:08:29.241 --> 00:08:32.011
"It was the best of times.
It was the worst of times.

00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:34.279
Cool!

00:08:34.279 --> 00:08:37.383
Let's not forget one important
point --

00:08:37.383 --> 00:08:39.485
Trump ran on a similar style
of racist incitement

00:08:39.485 --> 00:08:42.154
in 2018, and Republicans
lost by a historic margin

00:08:42.154 --> 00:08:44.924
in the midterms, including in
key swing states in the Midwest.

00:08:44.924 --> 00:08:46.124
So let's just remember that.

00:08:46.124 --> 00:08:47.626
Who knows what will happen
in 2020?

00:08:47.626 --> 00:08:50.429
But based on 2018, there's
a good chance he'll lose

00:08:50.429 --> 00:08:52.798
yet again in places like Ohio
and Wisconsin and...

00:08:52.798 --> 00:08:56.702
-North Carolina's "Nith Conde--"
Right?

00:08:56.702 --> 00:08:58.504
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:08:58.504 --> 00:08:59.905
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:59.905 --> 00:09:02.008 line:0%
♪♪

